        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "We had a great experience with Binning roofing company. Their pricing was competitive, and communication was very smooth. The job was completed on time and exactly as promised. They did amazing cleaning after the job was done. Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1761683072,
        "translated": false
