      {
        "author_name": "Goryee Wong",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113576017974254671046/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW9XvPgyBDN8uScWkgiGVXP_BiQmwnBLuF9Auyvd7YwmRumQiPH=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "So at first, I must admit I was skeptical because it was very hard to communicate from estimation to start of the project. I guess it's a busy season (it took two months wait).\n\nNow that the project is done, I must congratulate the two staffs that did an amazing job and the setup / cleanup they did. They went above and beyond to ensure the cleanliness of the surroundings (even the neighbors areas). They were also friendly and were able to answer all our questions (with Google translate).\n\nAmong everything, the price was right, the process was professional and the job is well done.\n\n[It was windy so the drone wasn't too steady 😂]",
        "time": 1753225583,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tenysiah Stevens",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102303140401298408976/reviews",
        "language": "en",
