        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXMSVlcOZ8sE2Hvnw1hpqhkoVQL2fyYba_0N6GQP7f74PLBLD8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I had a really good experience with this roofing company. They showed up when I needed help and didn’t waste any time. The price they gave me was awesome, and everything went super smooth from start to finish. No stress, no problems, solid work!",
        "time": 1761864050,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Harsh Patel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109393601378230194673/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIVR1pApcBiazZoIgNgQqk9jvMNiIj92nHGIBEU1AbzXPy-uw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "I had a great experience with Binning roofing company. They responded to my quote request promptly and took the time to clearly explain the scope of work. Their pricing was competitive. The job was completed on time and exactly as promised. They did amazing cleaning post roofing work so I didn't have to do anything. It's refreshing to work with a company that delivers on their word—highly recommended!",
